{"symbol":"EMEIS.PA","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:18:45Z","info":{"address1":"12, rue Jean Jaurès","address2":"Cedex","city":"Puteaux","zip":"92813","country":"France","phone":"33 1 47 75 78 07","website":"https://www.emeis.com","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","industryKey":"medical-care-facilities","industryDisp":"Medical Care Facilities","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"emeis Société anonyme operates nursing homes, assisted-living facilities, post-acute and rehabilitation hospitals, retirement homes, and psychiatric hospitals. Its services include concierge, housekeeping, ironing, internet connection, TV, telephone, free shuttles, catering and event organization, logistics support, DIY and gardening assistance, IT support, beauty and relaxation treatments, furniture on rent, fitness and wellness areas, and medical visits. The company's post-acute and rehabilitation hospitals offer services for geriatrics, musculoskeletal, nervous system, cardiovascular, hematology, and oncology conditions, as well as patients in a persistent vegetative state or in a minimally conscious state. Its psychiatric hospitals provide services for patients with mood disorders, anxiety disorders, obsessive-compulsive disorders, addictions, eating disorders, sleep disorders, personality disorders, schizophrenic disorders, autism spectrum disorders, psychotraumatic disorders, neurodegenerative diseases, perinatal psychiatry, and burn-out. It serves patients in France, Germany, Belgium, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, Spain, Italy, Portugal, Latin America, Austria, Croatia, Slovenia, Switzerland, the United Kingdom, Ireland, Poland, the United Arab Emirates, and China. The company was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Puteaux, France.","fullTimeEmployees":84600,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Laurent  Guillot","age":56,"title":"CEO, MD of France & Director","yearBorn":1969,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay"